WEBVTT

00:03:28.708 --> 00:03:32.240
Na sasa naonyesha idadi ya watoto kwa
mwanamke hapa:

00:03:32.240 --> 00:03:35.326
mbili, nne au sita --

00:03:35.326 --> 00:03:37.517
watoto wengi, watoto wachache.

00:03:37.517 --> 00:03:40.698
Na hapa mapato kwa mtu ikilinganishwa
dola.

00:03:40.698 --> 00:03:44.295
Sababu ya hio ni kua watu wengi wanasema
unapaswa kua tajiri kwanza

00:03:44.295 --> 00:03:45.965
kabla hujapata watoto wachache.

00:03:45.965 --> 00:03:49.597
Hivyo mapato ya chini hapa, mapato ya juu
pale.

00:03:49.597 --> 00:03:51.235
Na kweli mwaka 1960,

00:03:51.235 --> 00:03:53.972
ulitakiwa uwe Mkristo tajiri kuwa na
watoto wachache.

00:03:53.972 --> 00:03:56.246
Ilikua isipokua Japan.

00:03:56.246 --> 00:03:59.483
Japan hapa ilionekana ya kipekee.

00:03:59.483 --> 00:04:01.511
Vinginevyo ni nchi za Kikristo tu.